  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Voice",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Voice</strong> on the thumb bar. Without OpenDefence Main, open OpenDefence Voice from ATAK's ≡ menu.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2e57c8764c20cec7.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick a net first",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Voice connects by itself, with no sign in. <strong>JOIN A NET</strong> means you have not joined a net yet, so tap the <strong>NET</strong> header.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4f4526e0869132af.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open a group",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Nets sit in groups, with your unit's nets first and always open. Tap a group such as <strong>Teams</strong> to open it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e3a742de20a38804.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Join your net",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Join</strong> on the net you want. Voice remembers it and joins it again after a reconnect or a restart.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/84645886bcc0cf87.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Hold to talk",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Once you are in a net, hold the PTT and talk when it reads <strong>TRANSMITTING</strong>. Let go to stop.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d31e9840f5593c10.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mind the time limit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A press ends after 30 seconds. <strong>TIME LIMIT</strong> and a buzz warn you 5 seconds before.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b6c8641f605b067e.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
